    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 26 Answer: Help the girl extend the ladder to climb upstairs</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Steps cross-checked against an independent all-levels reference (current game version) and the embedded walkthrough video. Brain Puzzle 3 moves are drags as often as taps — if a tap does nothing, try dragging the object instead.</div>
