    </a>

    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Watch step 7 and step 8 back to back: the axe goes onto the tree, and the wood that comes back to the ladder is the only card in the level that does not end there.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap" id="video">
